@baseUrl = https://localhost:7142
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### W6-S1: Create CSS Custom-Property Theme
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/themes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Community Portal Theme",
  "slug": "community-portal-theme",
  "cssCustomProperties": {
    "--cms-accent": "#0F6CBD",
    "--cms-surface": "#FFFFFF"
  }
}

### W6-S1: Create Multi-Host Site
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Public Portal",
  "slug": "public-portal",
  "domains": ["portal.ruth.local"]
}

### W6-S1: Resolve Public CMS Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/public/resolve?siteSlug=public-portal&path=

### W6-S1: ShortLink QR SVG
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/public/shortlinks/join/qr.svg

### W6-S2: RSS 2.0 & JSON Feed 1.1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/channels/community-stories/feed.rss

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/channels/community-stories/feed.json

### W6-S2: Cached PersistedDataset
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/datasets/public-stories-feed

### W6-S3: High-Throughput Buffered Interaction Ingest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/public/interactions/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flushImmediately": true,
  "items": [
    {
      "channelKey": "member-portal",
      "componentKey": "home-page",
      "componentName": "Home Page",
      "operation": "View"
    }
  ]
}

### W6-S3: Resolve Adaptive Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cms/public/adaptive-messages/hero-callout/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "portal.ruth.local",
  "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 18_0 like Mac OS X) Mobile"
}

### W6-S4: Mobile v1 Bootstrap, Hydrated Page & DeepLink
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mobile/apps/member-companion/bootstrap?clientVersion=1.2.0

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mobile/apps/member-companion/pages/home

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mobile/apps/member-companion/deeplinks/resolve?path=/open/home

### W6-S4: Digital Signage, Apple TV & Roku Feeds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/signage/lobby-display/feed

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/signage/lobby-display/apple-tv

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/signage/lobby-display/roku
